WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.560
In America, we've taken bold action to swiftly shut down uncontrolled migration.

00:05.120 --> 00:08.620
Once we started detaining and deporting everyone who crossed the border

00:08.620 --> 00:11.900
and removing illegal aliens from the United States,

00:12.020 --> 00:13.240
they simply stopped coming.

00:13.340 --> 00:14.200
They're not coming anymore.

00:14.300 --> 00:16.080
We're getting a lot of credit, but they're not coming anymore.

